#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "General layout"
msgstr "Rèiteachadh coitcheann"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "Displaying the interface from the bottom is better if you use a bottom panel instead of the default top bar."
msgstr "Tha e nas fheàrr an eadar-aghaidh a shealltainn on bhonn ma chleachdas tu pannal aig a' bhonn an àite na bàr àrd bunaiteach."

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "From top to bottom"
msgstr "Bho bhàrr gu bonn"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "From bottom to top"
msgstr "Bho bhonn gu bàrr"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "The setting could not be saved"
msgstr "Cha b' urrainn dhuinn an roghainn a shàbhaladh"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "Number of emojis per line"
msgstr "An àireamh de dh'emojis gach loidhne"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "Size of emojis (px)"
msgstr "Meud nan emojis (px)"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "Layout"
msgstr "Rèiteachadh"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "Modifier keys must be between chevrons"
msgstr "Feumaidh iuchraichean atharrachaidh a bhith eadar bracaidean ceàrnach"

#: src/prefs.ts
#, javascript-format
msgid "The default value is %s"
msgstr "Is e %s an luach bunaiteach"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "Don't use a keyboard shortcut that already exists."
msgstr "Na cleachd ath-ghoirid meur-chlàir a tha ann mu thràth."

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "Use a keyboard shortcut to toggle the menu"
msgstr "Cleachd ath-ghoirid meur-chlàir gus an clàr-taice fhosgladh is a dhùnadh"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "Keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "Ath-ghoirid meur-chlàir"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "This is not a valid keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "Chan eil seo na ath-ghoirid meur-chlàir dhligheach"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "List of valid key names"
msgstr "Liosta de dh'ainmean iuchrach dligheach"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "Always show the icon in the panel"
msgstr "Seall an ìomhaigheag sa phannal an-còmhnaidh"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "If you access the menu with the keyboard shortcut, you don't need to always display the icon."
msgstr "Ma ruigeas tu an clàr-taice leis an ath-ghoirid meur-chlàir, cha leig thu leas an ìomhaigheag a shealltainn an-còmhnaidh."

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "Keyboard bindings"
msgstr "Ceanglaichean meur-chlàir"

#: src/prefs.ts src/lib/emojiMenu.ts
msgid "Emoji Selector"
msgstr "Emoji Selector"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "This extension provides a configurable popup menu displaying most emojis, clicking on an emoji copies it to the clipboard."
msgstr "Tha an leudachan seo a' solar clàr-taice pop-up so-rèiteachaidh a sheallas a' mhòr-chuid de na h-emojis; ma bhriogas tu air emoji, thèid lethbhreac dheth a chur dhan clipboard."

